    [
     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\">I think I found the problem, and the solution. Although I was using “strategy = 1” for Part 2, it looks like the epochvalues2csv is sensitive to what you put as the ndayswindow. If you put a value in dayswindow less than the actual number of days in your data, regardless of the “strategy” the epoch2values setting does not export the epoch values beyond ndayswindow and just repeats the epochs for the last full “ndayswindow” until a time point that would be the end of the data file.</div>"
    ],
